    "scenesThatPass": [
      "ARLENE: This way we can get back into the stairs without having to go through M the lobby and no one will ever see us and tell my Mom.\nBETSY: I know I said before that you were brilliant but I was wrong. You're a genius!",
      "BETSY: How do you do that?\nARLENE: Dear God, please let me win a date with Bobby because I’ve never won anything in my life.\nBETSY: You won that ice cream eating contest at Trevor Silverman’s Bar Mitzvah.\nARLENE: Nuh uh! I was disqualified because I barfed it all up.",
      "BETSY: You first!\nARLENE: Get away from us!",
      "ARLENE: Phew! She’s out like a light.\nARLENE: Look! It was a jewel heist!\nHELEN: Arlene, Betsy! What are you two doing up at this hour?! You're not even in your pajamas!\nARLENE: We haven’t done anything.",
      "ARLENE: Oh, can I eat at your house tonight? My Mom's working late. Again.\nBETSY: You don't even have to ask.\nARLENE: Thanks.\nBETSY: Duh."
    ]
